{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29979","headline":"龙翔寺阁夜怀渭南张少府 · 喻凫","name":"龙翔寺阁夜怀渭南张少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春城带病别，秋塞见除书。\n况是神仙吏，仍非尘土居。\n河风吹鸟迥，岳雨滴桐疎。\n坐阁驰思夕，沙东凉月虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻凫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}